Strands Decider v2 E2B

Derived from google/gemma-4-E2B-it, revision 3e22461f65e89153144f8adb70e3b8c2cc9845a7, under the Apache License 2.0
(https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/gemma_4_license).

Modifications: the text decoder was fine-tuned, and a decision readout of 255 rows, one per
answer code, takes the place of the generation output layer; it started from the tied
output-embedding rows of those codes. Every layer reads the prompt with the decision
interface's prefix-bidirectional attention. Every other part of the base model, its image
and audio input layers where it has them, is the base model's, unchanged.

